# Intent: A ringing timer or alarm ends on a touch: a press on the face or on the head strip calls maipai_timers_request_dismiss, which takes no lock; the timer tick ends the ring within 200 ms (how=touch or head). The press still reaches the rest of the touch code.
# Placement: unit (the ring and touch run on the robot)
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal/board/stackchan_display.cc, firmware/main/hal/hal_mcp.cpp (MIT)
